<titulo2><![CDATA[T-4 Apartment in center of Caldas Da Rainha, Santo Onofre]]></titulo2>
<descrip2><![CDATA[Exclusive Listing — Open House Saturday, August 15th from 1500h-1700h~~Spacious T4 apartment offering 4 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms, within walking distance of the city center. The apartment features a bright, functional kitchen with ample storage, and a versatile living area suited to modern family life. Bedrooms are generously proportioned with large windows that fill the space with natural light throughout the day, complemented by a private balcony ideal for laundry, storage, or simply relaxing outdoors.~~A dedicated parking space is included in the building's enclosed garage — a rare find for a central-location property.~~Perfectly suited for a family seeking proximity to the city center, or for investors looking to grow their portfolio in one of the Silver Coast's fastest-growing markets.~]]></descrip2>
